nd made the code cleaner to read for a upcoming update... also thanks to [arthursimao](https://github.com/arthursimao) for the new logo\r\n\r\n# 1.4.4\r\n- Made the logo better\r\n\r\n# 1.4.3\r\n- Fixed bug where on wierd ratio devices the `more-games-target-pos` would fail\r\n\r\n# 1.4.2\r\nA bugfix update\r\n- Fixed Links and Profile menu to overlap when the mod isnt enabled\r\n\r\n# 1.4.0\r\n- Re-added iOS support, and added social media menu toggle\r\n\r\n# 1.3.0\r\n- Removed iOS support\r\n\r\n# 1.2.0\r\n- Added Slide Type Changing (Back Out Looked Good So Thats The Default)\r\n\r\n\r\n# 1.1.0\r\n- Added 4:3 fix and More Buttons\r\n\r\n\r\n# 1.0.0\r\n- Initial mod release\r\n","created_at":"2025-11-12T10:53:09Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T18:57:10Z","links":{"community":null,"homepage":null,"source":"https://github.com/Bluescratch7545/Main-Menu-Plus"}}